OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA
OL,6,Fcontinuation of clear spells and
OL,7,Fscattered showers this evening. The
OL,8,Fshowers becoming mainly confined to
OL,9,Fwestern areas overnight. A cooler
OL,10,Fnight than last night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA largely dry and bright day
OL,13,Ffor many with sunny spells. A few
OL,14,Fshowers possible, mainly towards the
OL,15,Fwest. Temperatures nearer average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
