OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry
OL,6,Fstart Friday with a chance for some
OL,7,Frain arriving overnight and into
OL,8,Fsaturday. Clearing for a largely dry
OL,9,Fand bright weekend, although some
OL,10,Fovernight fog possible. Temperatures
OL,11,Fnear average.
